                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "A Blanket Label",
                                  "A blanket tag\nnames the person\nwho sewed it and\nthe person who",
                                  "checked it.\nNeither name is\nlarge. Someone has\nadded a third line",
                                  "for whoever\nrepairs it next.\nThe tag assumes\nthe blanket will\nlive",
                                  "long enough to\nneed another kind\npair of hands."
